WEBVTT

00:00:58.426 --> 00:01:03.259
while another meeting discussed
pretty much events that happened at school

00:01:03.283 --> 00:01:06.427
and how to solve
disputes between siblings,

00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:08.330
by which I mean real fights.

00:01:09.232 --> 00:01:13.042
At the end of each meeting,
we'd reach decisions and agreements

00:01:13.066 --> 00:01:16.830
that would last at least
until the next meeting.

00:01:16.854 --> 00:01:21.345
So you could say
I was raised as a politician.

00:01:23.105 --> 00:01:26.820
By the age of six or seven,
I mastered politics.

00:01:26.844 --> 00:01:29.687
I was negotiating, compromising,

00:01:29.711 --> 00:01:32.519
building alliances
with other political actors.